Z||000001||theogre||10-26-1999||01:55 PM||||if yours was just a bad gear, then I think there are places to find other gears. That sort of thing id definatly repairable.<P>I wouldn't use a tranny with a broke case tho. It's likely to have cracks in places that haven't shown up yet. Cracks that could cause vary ugly kinds of failures while your driving.||||reg||1
